   "body": "## Review details\n\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suppressed comments (1)</summary>\n\n**src/vs/workbench/contrib/snippets/browser/snippetCompletionProvider.ts:156**\n* This length check only fixes two-character prefixes. For a prefix such as `(abc)` with the cursor before `)` in `(abc)!`, suffix matching has already advanced `endColumn` past `)`, but this condition still increments it and the replace operation deletes `!`. Gate the increment on the computed range instead (and cover both exact-pair and longer bracketed prefixes in regression tests).\n```\n\t\t\t\t\tsnippet.prefix.length !== p.open.length + p.close.length\n```\n</details>\n\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 1/1 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 0 new\n- **Review effort level:** Balanced\n\n",
